  "problem": "Which of the following is a $3\\times 2$ matrix?\n\n$$\nL=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,M=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -6\\end{aligned}],\\,N=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
